    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-identifier-context",
        "moduleId": "why-names",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材中的标识符定义",
        "markdown": "教材在说明变量时指出：变量只是计算机内存中用于存储信息的一部分，与字面常量不同，必须通过名称来访问，因此需要为它命名。教材把**标识符（Identifiers）**定义为“为某些东西提供的给定名称”，变量就是标识符的一个例子。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000052"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "基础",
                "标识符命名"
              ],
              "lineStart": 440,
              "lineEnd": 441,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "078eacd82c77078def029b535658cd7c3bdd46e0907ed833a77894260c6199e9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-name-purpose",
        "moduleId": "why-names",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "名称是访问值的入口",
        "markdown": "名称让程序能够再次找到某个值。执行 `age = 18` 之后，后续代码通过 `age` 读取或替换这个值；如果同一个值没有名字，就只能反复书写字面常量。可读性好的名称还能让读者在未看实现时大致猜出它的用途。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-identifier-context"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-formation-rule",
        "moduleId": "formation-rules",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材给出的构成规则",
        "markdown": "教材给出的标识符构成规则有两条：第一个字符必须是字母表中的字母（大写或小写 ASCII 字母，也可以是 Unicode 字符）或下划线 `_`；从第二个字符开始，可以使用字母、下划线或数字 `0` 到 `9`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000052"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "基础",
                "标识符命名"
              ],
              "lineStart": 440,
              "lineEnd": 441,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "078eacd82c77078def029b535658cd7c3bdd46e0907ed833a77894260c6199e9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-rule-intuition",
        "moduleId": "formation-rules",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "按位置检查构成字符",
        "markdown": "可以把规则拆成一个检查顺序：先看第一个字符是否为字母或下划线；再逐位检查其余字符是否只包含字母、下划线和数字。空格、连字符、`>` 等符号不在允许集合内，因此只要出现就说明名称非法。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-formation-rule"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-validity-drill",
        "moduleId": "formation-rules",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "逐项判断教材例子",
        "markdown": "按上述规则逐项判断教材给出的例子：\n\n- `i`、`name_2_3`：合法。\n- `2things`：首字符是数字，非法。\n- `this is spaced out`：包含空格，非法。\n- `my-name`：包含连字符，非法。\n- `>a1b2_c3`：包含 `>`，非法。\n\n这个检查只覆盖构成字符；名称是否已被占用、是否与关键字冲突，还需要额外检查。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-formation-rule",
            "model-rule-intuition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-keyword-boundary",
        "moduleId": "formation-rules",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "规则之外的关键字边界",
        "markdown": "即使字符组合完全符合规则，名称也不能与 Python 的保留关键字同名，例如 `if`、`for`、`class` 都不能直接作为变量名。教材本节说明的是字符构成规则；关键字限制是模型补充的边界条件，实际取名时应把两者一起检查。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-formation-rule",
            "model-validity-drill"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-case-sensitivity",
        "moduleId": "case-and-validity",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材强调的大小写敏感",
        "markdown": "教材强调标识符名称区分大小写：`myname` 和 `myName` 并不等同，前者最后一个字母是小写 `n`，后者是大写 `N`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000052"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "基础",
                "标识符命名"
              ],
              "lineStart": 440,
              "lineEnd": 441,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "078eacd82c77078def029b535658cd7c3bdd46e0907ed833a77894260c6199e9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-case-consequence",
        "moduleId": "case-and-validity",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "大小写不同就是两个名字",
        "markdown": "因为区分大小写，`user_name` 与 `UserName` 会被 Python 当成两个不同的名字。若定义时写 `total_count`、使用时误写 `Total_count`，程序不会自动纠正，而会报告该名称未定义。团队应选定一种大小写风格并一致使用，避免只靠大小写区分不同含义。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-case-sensitivity"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-naming-habits",
        "moduleId": "readable-naming",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "application",
        "title": "在合法之上追求可读",
        "markdown": "在满足语法规则后，命名还要服务于阅读。Python 代码中常用的做法是：变量和函数使用小写字母，单词之间用下划线连接，如 `user_name`、`retry_count`；名字要表达用途而不是难以理解的类型缩写，避免 `a`、`data1`、`tmp` 这类无法说明含义的名称；布尔值可以用 `is_`、`has_` 开头表达判断含义。大小写风格一旦选定，就应在同一项目中保持一致。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-formation-rule",
            "model-case-consequence"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-check-exercise",
        "moduleId": "check-and-transfer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "判断并说明依据",
        "markdown": "判断下列名称能否作为变量名，并说明依据：`_count`、`3days`、`total price`、`total-price`、`TotalPrice`、`for`。\n\n参考答案：`_count` 合法；`3days` 首字符为数字，非法；`total price` 含空格，非法；`total-price` 含连字符，非法；`TotalPrice` 的字符构成合法，且与全小写写法因大小写不同而相异；`for` 是关键字，不能用作变量名。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-formation-rule",
            "textbook-case-sensitivity"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-summary",
        "moduleId": "check-and-transfer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "检查清单与下一点",
        "markdown": "标识符是变量等对象的名称。判断一个名称能否使用，依次检查首字符、后续字符、大小写一致性和关键字冲突；在合法的基础上，再选择能表达用途、风格统一的名称。下一节将在这个命名基础上讨论数据类型。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-identifier-context",
            "textbook-formation-rule",
            "textbook-case-sensitivity",
            "model-check-exercise"
          ]
        }
      }
